  lectureTitle: Key Door System
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c073c4f89e9167644afdb558223a211c, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'System with Keys and matching Doors that are opened with that
    same Key.


    In this Scenario the Player can move around, touch Keys to pick
    them up which adds them to the Inventory. Then by approaching a Door the player
    can use the Key of the same color to open it.'
